WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:08.360
You know, the universe is so large, we can't even begin to fathom it.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.400
And time has been flowing for an eternity...

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.200
And yet, we were able to meet.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.040
Do you think it's a miracle?

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.870
I don't think it is.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.540
I mean...

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.000
Our encounter had to be destined.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.210
Destined?

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:34.090
Yes, like one single bee out of a swarm...

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:37.470
Like a single flower out of a myriad...

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.390
They come together to bear a mellow fruit.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:46.560
Single droplets of night mist that fall from the leaves

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.440
fill the springs that become the foundation of a great river.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.070
I'm sure that our encounter held meaning.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.450
Meaning? How so?

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.910
Well, for example...

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.000
To make me fall in love?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.460
I've been feeling this way since we first met.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.670
I love you!

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.600
You can't...

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:20.430
Huh?

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.560
I wanted to say it first.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.110
We'll always be together.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.870
Yes. Forever and ever.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.040
Cut!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.300
That's a wrap for "The Lily and the Spaceship"!

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.920
Thank you, everyone!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.380
Thank you!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.140
You did it!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.140
That was perfect!

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.390
It's over.

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:02.720
Uh-huh.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.480
That was a little embarrassing, wasn't it?

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.020
Yes.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.480
That was the last job for the Jersey Club.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.400
Good job, Lan.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.650
Good job, Madoka.

