00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:54.000
It has been two weeks since the delegation

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.500
from Le Garite came to Earth.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.920
Today, their representative and the U.N. delegate

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.920
Hey, look up there!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.880
met in a conference for the 12th time

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:06.260
at the Kamogawa Municipal Auditorium in Kamogawa City, Chiba Prefecture.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:10.560
Also participating in the meetings were the Prime Minister, the Foreign Minister,

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.770
the governor of Chiba Prefecture and mayor of Kamogawa City.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:19.030
The talks were conducted cordially interspersed with occasional planetary and regional jokes.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.940
Reserved for the day

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.940
Sorry

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.940
A princess from a distant planet!

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.240
How romantic!

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:26.990
But I still can't believe it. Are you seriously an alien?

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.200
Can I touch you?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.660
Huh? S-Sure...

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.630
Hey, come on. Stop slapping her like a sumo wrestler.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.420
Here you go!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.590
I'll keep bringing out food, so eat up.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.090
Besides, Uncle's cooking, not me!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.510
Here you go!

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.510
I'll help too.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.470
What are you saying?!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
Lan!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
Have

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
a

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
back

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
to

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
your

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
safe

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
journey

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
home

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
planet!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.470
And the wrap party for "The Lily and The Spaceship"!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:48.470
You're the guest of honor, so sit back and enjoy yourself!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:51.930
It will be lonely around the shop again.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.230
How many times do I need to repeat myself? No gloomy talk!

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.940
She's right, Mr. Hiroshi!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.690
You're coming right back to Earth, aren't you?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.320
I'm not sure about that.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:05.360
Huh?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.320
What?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:11.290
Intergalactic travel isn't that easy.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.580
Are you saying this is really good-bye?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.920
Lan...

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.260
Lan!

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.260
Lan!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.340
Lan!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.550
Lan should just play along

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.550
Take good care of yourself.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.800
and say she's coming right back.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.350
We'll never forget you, Lan!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.810
She's just too honest.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.810
So please don't forget about us too!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.610
All right, that's enough!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:43.150
How can Lan go back to her planet feeling happy with a send-off like that?!

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:48.870
Princess Lan, will you spare a few parting words to us plebeians?

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:49.990
What?

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.410
Ahem!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.750
We are gathered here today under such wonderful weather...

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.960
Not like that...

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.100
No one is surprised anymore

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.430
by the fact that you're an alien.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.270
Uh-huh.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.690
It's been two weeks since that incident.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:21.900
You're right.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.030
Wow!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.160
How beautiful!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.370
Isn't it?

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:34.990
I should've brought you here to the Hill of Vows earlier,

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.250
but it totally slipped my mind.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.210
The Hill of Vows?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:49.760
I vow that we will meet again in Kamogawa some day.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.720
You too, Lan!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.470
All right. I vow too.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:57.430
Good.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.230
Until we meet again, in Kamogawa! Madoka & Lan & Muginami

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.860
As long as this lock remains here

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:07.570
we must honor our vow, no matter what.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.660
I wish Muginami were here too...

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.620
Do you think we'll all meet again?

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.380
Yes, absolutely.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:29.840
After all, the view before us is still here.

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.470
That's right.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.680
Yes.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.980
It's because you protected it.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.530
Flowers?

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:19.720
Why did it have to be Sis... Why us?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.440
<i>If you wanted to hurt someone</i>

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:25.900
Madoka!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.150
<i>you should have just done it to me.</i>

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:32.190
<i>I've been ready to risk my life for a long time.</i>

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.860
<i>I was prepared...</i>

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.320
Madoka...

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:40.750
Why does it always have to be the ones I love?

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.400
If I try to go in for close-range combat, my craft will mutate.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.400
<i>Damage report!</i>

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:16.530
Long-range attacks are ineffective as well.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:16.530
<i>Ovids Garua, Baizand, and Nekusan are out of commission</i>

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.280
So what are my options now?

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:17.660
<i>due to the effects of the anomaly!</i>

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.580
<i>Detecting an ultra-sized energy field!</i>

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.210
What is that?

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.210
What's about to happen here?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.230
What is the situation with the energy field?

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.030
It's growing even larger!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.440
Phochville Ships 1 and 2 are going to be swallowed up!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.370
All ships within the field range are to go into overdrive without hesitation!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.660
Get out of there!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:07.750
Aura, Lympha and Ignis...

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.420
The telemetry from each one is off the grid!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.300
Just what is happening, Moid?

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.760
Shut the hell up! Don't talk to me now!{alpha as fuck}

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:20.050
Can't you see I'm trying to enjoy the best part?

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:24.600
Uehara!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.430
Yes sir!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.180
Can we communicate with the pilots?

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.270
We can't. We're disconnected from all three—

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.280
No, wait! It's Aura...

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.820
What is this... static?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.550
There are lots of people I want to protect.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:11:00.630
There's Sis, Uncle, everyone at school...

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:08.350
The people of Kamogawa... and... and...

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:14.650
Hey... Was I really the right choice?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.610
Do I really have what it takes?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.070
If I say you don't, are you going to give up?

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.490
If it's impossible, it's impossible.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:28.000
You don't know that until you try.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.920
It's a fact that you were chosen.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.380
But whether or not you can do it, no one knows.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.630
In other words...

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.050
It's all up to you.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.420
"All up to me"?

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.930
Before I came here, there was someone else.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:51.060
She went back to her own world, almost like she was switching places with me.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.060
She said she was going to try once again.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.440
But I didn't ask what she was going to do.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:01.320
Have you ever thought of leaving this place?

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.410
I'm staying here because...

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.240
that's the path I've chosen.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.410
I see...

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.210
So...

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.510
who are you?

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.520
"That's the path I've chosen", huh.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.360
That's so cool!

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.530
Let's try this...

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.290
my way!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.160
<i>Lan!</i>

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.540
<i>Muginami!</i>

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.130
Let's go...

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.670
together!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:14.730
What?

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.690
The only thing I can do...

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.730
is to fly with everything I've got, just like this!

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:47.220
A-Aura!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.000
It's beautiful...

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.130
Well?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:26.340
Does my kid sister have potential?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.010
Yes...

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.180
She's an outrageous girl

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.930
that Kyouno Madoka.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.560
Sis? She's alive!

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.150
Midori, Sis is okay!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.780
What happened?

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.030
What the heck?!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.630
What's wrong, Madoka?

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.380
<i>Midori stopped moving!</i>

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:07.420
Why?

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.760
<i>I don't know! Maybe she fell asleep?</i>

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.140
Hey, wake up! Come on, Midori!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:19.390
Bravo! That was a brilliant illusion.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:24.770
There is no doubt that the Voxes hide a frightening power.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:28.360
In fact, we just saw the proof.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.320
Villagiulio!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:39.120
It appears that in order for the people of De Metrio to sleep safely at night...

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.370
you must be put to sleep!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.460
You! The leader of the giant demons!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.390
Brother...

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.890
Brother!

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.440
It can't be...

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.900
Dizelmine...

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:14.360
Eliminate all resistant forces within Earth's domain.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.330
There is no need to pursue anyone who flees.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:18.540
Yes, my lord.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:36.760
{OP song starts around here}

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:37.810
Muginami!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:38.970
<i>Let her go!</i>

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.730
If she stays, my brother will definitely kill them...

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:46.810
Both Villagiulio, and Muginami for trying to save him.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:58.240
If I knew earlier that my brother's ship was coming to get me,

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.330
I wouldn't have let Muginami go to battle.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.250
I'm sorry, Madoka.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.790
It's not your fault, Lan.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.340
I hope she's doing okay.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.510
I wonder what planet she's on?

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.140
I'll find her.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:19.560
Huh?

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:22.020
I'll find her and we'll return together.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.770
To this town, where the three of us first met.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.350
I promise.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.400
And when that time comes,

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.900
will you let us be your comrades again?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.450
Yes!

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.790
Well... I'll be going, okay?

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.330
Uh-huh.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.640
See you!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.100
See you!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:09.980
Bye-bye!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.520
Bye-bye!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:13.980
Bye-bye!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:15.820
Bye-bye!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.610
See you again!

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:20.320
See you again!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.530
Bye-bye!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.910
Bye-bye!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.420
Bye-bye!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.440
Succe—

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:10.500
<i>And so, Muginami left and Lan returned to her home planet</i>

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.130
<i>and time passed.</i>

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:15.340
<i>And autumn in Kamogawa slowly came to an end.</i>

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:18.300
We're counting on you, Madoka!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:19.630
You got it!

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:26.520
Stop! Stop!

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:30.440
Safe!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:31.730
You did it!

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.610
Madoka, help!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:35.110
Okay!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.190
<i>At dawn's break...</i>

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:41.110
<i>As though lit by the morning moon...</i>

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:38.740
Got it!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:42.160
Huh?

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.700
Madoka!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.080
Bring it on!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.620
Hey, Kyouno!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.460
Oh, just a minute!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.630
The next opening I have in the Jersey Club schedule is...

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.630
Not that. You received a letter.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:57.250
Huh?

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.630
It's addressed to the Jersey Club.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.800
<i>Midori hasn't moved since that day.</i>

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:07.560
<i>Even the people on Pharos don't seem to know why.</i>

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:11.640
<i>So many things happened that I think she just wants to rest.</i>

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.100
<i>Yeah, I'm sure that's it.</i>

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:19.440
<i>Mr. Moid returned to Le Garite with Lan and her brother.</i>

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.110
<i>Because of that, it's like the wind has been taken out of Mr. Tadokoro's sails.</i>

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:24.570
H-Hot!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.870
<i>My sister Youko recovered completely from her injuries.</i>

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.160
<i>Just what I'd expect from her.</i>

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.210
<i>The scar doesn't bother her one bit.</i>

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:39.710
<i>She seems to have gotten close to Asteria lately.</i>

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:44.970
Madoka said that during the last battle, she realized she was on a beach.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.090
A beach?

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:49.220
And she got some advice from a girl she didn't know.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:54.560
I see. So she saw her too.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:21:00.480
Isn't it about time you shared your story with me too?

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.690
If I did, what would you do?

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:05.910
Nothing. I'm just curious.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:11.910
They say girls who are too curious miss their chance at marriage.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:19.840
I am the witch who pulled this universe into an eternal loop

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.300
comprised of peace and calamity.

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:26.510
But don't worry, I promise I'll disappear.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.520
Once Madoka severs this...

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.430
endless cycle of Rin-ne.

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:37.810
Come on—!

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:41.780
I was looking forward to the roasted roe inside!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.530
Isn't this the...?

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:51.410
The Chairman of Novumundus is your personal reference, huh...?

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.750
<i>I saw Lan recently.</i>

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:01.710
<i>We talked about so many things.</i>

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>About each other, about our future, and about you... Madoka.</i>

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:08.970
<i>We ended up arguing again,</i>

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:12.680
<i>but we made up just like when we were a trio.</i>

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>We argued a lot and made up a lot.</i>

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:19.980
<i>And now, I love you two even more.</i>

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:22.270
<i>Even if I squint really hard,</i>

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:25.400
<i>I still can't see the Earth from here.</i>

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:29.740
<i>But... I promise I'll return to Kamogawa some day.</i>

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:33.330
<i>When I do, let's argue lots and lots!</i>

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:36.540
<i>To my dearest Madoka...</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.340
Success!

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.930
Didn't I tell you to hold on to it since the wind is blowing?

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:52.720
You never listen to your mother!

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:53.890
Just a minute!

00:22:55.180 --> 00:22:57.180
I'll get it for you in a jiffy!

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:04.770
I'll be right there!
